{
  "slug": "darce",
  "name": "Darce",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Stop vibecoding blind. Darce teaches you what the AI just built, concept breakdowns, pattern analysis, and quizzes on your actual code. Three modes: Ship (just code), Understand (see explanations), Learn (get quizzed)",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **3 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `teach` (Automatically explains code patterns and decisions after writing or editing files)\n- **Commands** (3): `explain` (Explain a specific file or concept in depth), `quiz` (Quiz yourself on the code you just shipped), `teach` (Break down recent code changes — explain patterns, decisions, and tradeoffs)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install darce@claude-community` from `AmerSarhan/darce` (`claude-code-plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
